# Allowlist: only the page, the extractor scripts and the built website are published.
# The store's Excel exports and every other working file stay on this computer.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!update.bat
!make_site.py
!build_all_dashboard.py
!build_topic2.py
!build_topic3.py
!build_topic4.py
!build_topic5.py
!board/
!board/index.html
!docs/
!docs/index.html
!docs/.nojekyll
!docs/data/
!docs/data/*.json
# never publish source spreadsheets, even if one is copied into an allowed folder
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
